0026:       non-background vertical marker color somewhere below the last gap.
0027:     Rule
0028:     - For each gap column, sort its gaps by row. Paint from the top through each
0029:       gap row with that row's horizontal-bar color, then paint the remaining
0030:       lower part of the column with the marker color found below the last gap.
